# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every OS (Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true otherwise rewrite them as CRLF, which breaks the byte-exact design-archive check).
# Binary files are detected and left alone; the -text rules below and in sub-folder .gitattributes keep pinned bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
mobile/assets/licenses/OFL-Amiri.txt text eol=lf
mobile/tests/fixtures/khatmDuaApproved.txt text eol=lf
